  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till ANE f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra sk&#xf6;tseln av landets regionala v&#xe4;gn&#xe4;t. Syftet &#xe4;r att m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra f&#xf6;r milj&#xf6;riktig ekonomisk utvecklning p&#xe5;     landsbygden genom att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra underh&#xe5;ll och administration av de    reegionala v&#xe4;garna.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project for institutional support for the        decentralisation of Regional Roads, phase 1 enabling environment for  the management of regional roads is for the environmentally           acceptable development of the rural areas of Mozambique and to        improve the quality of regional roads network and the administration  of the maintenance and development management</narrative>
  </description>
